---
// SystemStatus.astro — about/bio as whoami / system-status readout
---

<section id="system" class="system-section zone">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="section-label">// SYSTEM — WHOAMI</h2>
    <div class="system-grid">
      <div class="terminal-window">
        <div class="terminal-chrome">
          <span class="dot dot-red"></span>
          <span class="dot dot-yellow"></span>
          <span class="dot dot-green"></span>
          <span class="terminal-title">souf@infra:~</span>
        </div>
        <div class="terminal-body">
          <p class="status-line"><span class="caret">></span> <span class="status-label">System_Status:</span> <span class="status-val status-active">Active</span></p>
          <p class="status-line"><span class="caret">></span> <span class="status-label">Base:</span> <span class="status-val">Taroudant, Morocco</span></p>
          <p class="status-line"><span class="caret">></span> <span class="status-label">Background:</span> <span class="status-val">Bac+2 DTS Systems &amp; Network (ISTA Taroudant) → Systems &amp; Network technician at DEWEB Technology, Casablanca (intern → full-time) → Licence GI, final year</span></p>
          <p class="status-line"><span class="caret">></span> <span class="status-label">Current_Focus:</span> <span class="status-val">[ Docker, Docker Compose, Kubernetes (k3s), CI/CD (GitHub Actions), Prometheus/Grafana observability ]</span></p>
          <p class="status-line"><span class="caret">></span> <span class="status-label">Target:</span> <span class="status-val">DevOps / DevSecOps engineer</span></p>
          <p class="status-line"><span class="caret">></span> <span class="status-label">Next:</span> <span class="status-val">Master's abroad (France/Italy) — Autumn 2027</span></p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="system-aside">
        <p class="aside-kicker">// context</p>
        <p class="bio">
          Spent two years as a systems &amp; network technician at a managed services shop in Casablanca —
          enough to know that the interesting problems live upstream of the hardware, in the pipelines and
          infrastructure that make deployments repeatable and failures observable. DevOps is where that
          background meets the CS theory I'm finishing now.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .system-section {
    padding-block: clamp(4.5rem, 10vh, 7rem);
  }

  .section-label {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--accent-2);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .system-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.45fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 4rem);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .terminal-window {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .terminal-chrome {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    background: var(--surface-2);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .dot {
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .dot-red    { background: var(--danger); }
  .dot-yellow { background: var(--warn); }
  .dot-green  { background: var(--accent); }

  .terminal-title {
    margin-left: auto;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }

  .terminal-body {
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  .status-line {
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .caret {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-right: 0.5rem;
  }

  .status-label {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }

  .status-val {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .status-active {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .system-aside {
    padding-top: 0.35rem;
  }

  .aside-kicker {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--accent-2);
    opacity: 0.85;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .bio {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .system-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>